{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"735717488045588521","content":"They stand on the spire of the tower, watching the city's evening glow, looking out over the Thames. They feel a surge of *eureka* come through their brain... an invention! But that's a thing for another time. Now is the time to reflect.\n\n*London. I've spent only days walking on your cobbled roads, flying amongst your haunting smoke, but I can already feel something within me.*\n\n*All those years I've spent manipulating my family, all under the guise of nobility. The years I've spent taxing the poor in my grandfather's name. The years I've spent oppressing and controlling and undermining. Those years end here.*\n\n*It's only been a moon-cycle or two since I met these people. My greatest friend out of them has perished. I'd be lost if it weren't for the future I can see within these stars...*\n\n*These stars... will they be the same stars I look at in the next few weeks? I'm sure they'll be similar. If anything's for sure, it's that Jack – the kind stranger that lit up the warm hearth of compassion within my heart – Jack is up there. And soon will you be, Galileo. And so is Cosimo, but so is every other man and woman and person that has graced this earth with their soles.*\n\n*Compassion takes many forms,* They say, taking out their telescope, *But the kind Jack, and so many others have shown me is special. It was selfless, generous, and wholehearted. I ought to be more like that.*\n\n*And so I will. With this new world, I'll gaze upon the stars and see the new life, the new space, the new galaxies and supernovae and astrophysical secrets they hold.* They look through and find the brightest \"star\" in the sky: Neptune. *Jack, and all the rest of you, you live in the heavens now. Thank you for alighting upon this world we dwell in. We'll never forget you – I'll never forget you.*\n\nThey mark down the \"star\" as *Jennerius*, and tuck the telescope back into their *Bag of Holding*. \n\n\"Now, it's time to party,\" They grin, and dive off the spire, speeding to <#636017934723973133>.","created_at":"2020-07-25T04:29:06.268000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736439865255788674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
